1
00:00:00,535 --> 00:00:03,245
(Penny:)Okay, well, it sounds like
things are gonna work out.

2
00:00:03,413 --> 00:00:05,203
(Leonard:)Yeah. Yeah, it's all good.

3
00:00:05,374 --> 00:00:08,334
Everything's gonna work out,
one way or another.

4
00:00:08,835 --> 00:00:10,505
God, come on, Leonard.

5
00:00:10,671 --> 00:00:14,091
(Penny:)You are entitled to try and make things
go the way you want them to.

6
00:00:14,841 --> 00:00:16,551
(Leonard:)- Really?
- Yes.

7
00:00:16,718 --> 00:00:19,258
(Penny:)You don't always have to go along
with what the woman wants.

8
00:00:19,763 --> 00:00:21,183
(Steph:)Huh.

9
00:00:22,307 --> 00:00:27,147
(Penny:)- What?
- Nothing. Just rethinking my whole life.

10
00:00:31,525 --> 00:00:34,485
(Leonard:)Okay, here's the thing.

11
00:00:34,653 --> 00:00:38,403
(Leonard:)I'm afraid that if I ask her to move out,
she'll just dump me.

12
00:00:38,573 --> 00:00:40,823
Well, that's a chance you have to take.

13
00:00:40,993 --> 00:00:43,413
(Penny:)I mean, look, if it's meant to be, it'll be.

14
00:00:44,746 --> 00:00:46,666
(Leonard:)Very comforting.

15
00:00:48,041 --> 00:00:51,131
(Leonard:)Okay, so, what do I say to her?

16
00:00:51,753 --> 00:00:53,753
(Leonard:)I don't know.
What have women said to you...

17
00:00:53,922 --> 00:00:56,592
(Penny:)...when they wanted
to slow a relationship down?

18
00:00:56,758 --> 00:01:03,018
(Leonard:)I really like you,
but I wanna see how things go with Mark?

